// Tower Pro SG90, the 9 g micro servo in Arduino starter kits. The mechanical travel is
// 0.5 ms at 0° to 2.4 ms at 180°. The Luxorparts sheet's 1 ms to 2 ms is the nominal range
// around centre, not the stops. Tower Pro's page gives the 4.8 V speed and the 1 µs dead
// band. SunFounder's SF0180 specification gives the currents. The control board is an AA51880.
{
  "format": 6,
